Fluent UI System Icons
----------------------

The icons on the buttons are a subset of Fluent UI System Icons
(https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons), compiled into rcommander.exe as the font
crates/rcommander/resources/icons/rcommander-icons.ttf. The symbol collection for own commands
and button bar buttons is a second subset of the same icons, compiled in as the font
crates/rcommander/resources/icons/rcommander-symbols.ttf.

